  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action On Podoconiosis and Integrated Development Organisation (APIDO) APIDO is an Ethiopian NGO created solely for the relief of suffering from Podoconiosis through effective prevention and treatment programs.APIDO&#x2019;s first project in 2012 involved setting up six treatment sites in Health Centres across Wolayita, Gamo Gofa and Dawro. APIDO also set up and support shoe workshops &#x2013; employing and training young locals to make custom, over-sized shoes for Podo patients.</narrative>
